# The build context is an allowlist: everything is excluded, then the release's
# inputs are named. Credentials (.env) and generated data (data/, _build/,
# deps/) stay out of the context because nothing here admits them.
*

!mix.exs
!mix.lock
!config/config.exs
!config/runtime.exs
!assets
# The image downloads the vendored packages itself, from the lock file.
assets/vendor
!lib
!core
# Cargo's build output stays out, so the image compiles the core itself.
core/target
!priv/static/manifest.webmanifest
!priv/static/icons
!priv/openapi.json
